WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.363 --> 00:00:09.110
Engagement keeps a history with every customer, and sends promo emails through your own Mailchimp account. In this video, you’ll build a campaign.

2
00:00:10.146 --> 00:00:17.570
On every customer, Log activity records calls, meetings, emails, and notes, next to the promo emails they were sent.

3
00:00:18.597 --> 00:00:23.440
Open Engagement to see your campaigns. Save emails you send often as templates.

4
00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:34.171
In a campaign, choose who gets it, for example active customers who bought in the last 90 days, and see how many that is. Preview the email as you write it.

5
00:00:35.207 --> 00:00:43.058
Send a test, send it now, or schedule it, then see opens and clicks. Only customers who agreed to promo emails get them.

6
00:00:44.075 --> 00:00:46.230
That’s Engagement. Next, Social.

